<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Delete your Recovery Co Pilot account</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0c1021;
        --card: #111a2e;
        --border: #1f2b47;
        --text: #e9edf7;
        --muted: #9aa6c4;
        --accent: #7a8bff;
        --accent-2: #6dd8ff;
        --danger: #ff7a7a;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 24px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(109, 216, 255, 0.08), transparent 30%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(122, 139, 255, 0.1), transparent 35%),
          var(--bg);
        font-family: "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 28px 26px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      h2 {
        margin: 24px 0 12px;
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #f3f6ff;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(122, 139, 255, 0.12);
        color: #dfe5ff;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .badge-danger {
        color: #ffeaea;
        background: rgba(255, 122, 122, 0.14);
      }
      .steps {
        margin: 18px 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }
      .step {
        position: relative;
        padding: 16px 16px 16px 54px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #0f172a;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .step::before {
        content: attr(data-step);
        position: absolute;
        left: 16px;
        top: 14px;
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
        color: #0d1021;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .list {
        padding-left: 18px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        padding: 14px 22px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(122, 139, 255, 0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(122, 139, 255, 0.12), rgba(109, 216, 255, 0.12));
        color: #f4f7ff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(122, 139, 255, 0.25);
      }
      .muted {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .panel {
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      .danger {
        color: var(--danger);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      a {
        color: #8ecbff;
      }
      @media (max-width: 520px) {
        body {
          padding: 16px;
        }
        .container {
          padding: 22px 18px;
        }
        .step {
          padding: 14px 14px 14px 50px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="pill">Account & Data Deletion</div>
      <h1>Delete your Recovery Co Pilot account</h1>
      <p>
        You can permanently delete your account and the data stored with Recovery Co Pilot. This action is
        irreversible.
      </p>

      <h2>What will be deleted</h2>
      <div class="panel">
        <ul class="list">
          <li>Your sign-in account (email or Google-authenticated).</li>
          <li>Your profile, step progress, sponsorship/meeting data, and journal content stored in our database.</li>
          <li>Locally cached data on your device (cleared on next app launch after deletion).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>How to delete your account</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step" data-step="1">
          Open the app, sign in, and go to the <strong>Menu</strong> → <strong>Profile</strong> (Account settings).
        </li>
        <li class="step" data-step="2">
          Select <strong>Delete Account</strong> and follow the prompts.<br />
          <span class="muted">Email/password users: confirm your password. Google users may need to re-authenticate with Google.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="step" data-step="3">
          Confirm deletion. Your account and associated cloud data will be removed, and you’ll be signed out.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Important notes</h2>
      <div class="panel badge-danger">
        <p class="danger">Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          If prompted to re-authenticate, complete that step to finish deletion. After deletion, local cache clears on next
          launch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
